# The ts-rs bindings are rewritten in full by `pnpm gen:types`, which always
# writes LF. Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks them out as CRLF and git
# then reports all ~80 as modified after every regeneration even though the
# content is identical — noise on exactly the workflow the CI freshness gate
# polices.
#
# Deliberately scoped to the generated directories rather than `* text=auto
# eol=lf`, which would be correct but renormalizes every tracked file in the
# repo and belongs in its own change.
src/lib/domains/*/generated/** text eol=lf
